  - Constraints: 30s duration, Mobile Vertical Format

> Reasoning Chain:
  1. Style Fusion: Blend high-tech "Cyberpunk" aesthetics with grounded "Vlog" pacing. Humor from contrast.
  2. Pacing Strategy: 30s = 3 beats (Hook -> Action -> Punchline).
